@startuml
title Gold Miner Client-Server Architecture

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

node "Client Machine 1" {
  component "client.py\nHuman Player 1" as C1
}

node "Client Machine 2" {
  component "client.py\nHuman Player 2" as C2
}

node "Client Machine 3" {
  component "client.py\nHuman Player 3" as C3
}

node "Server Machine" {
  component "server.py\nSequencer Server" as S
  component "game.py\nGame Logic" as G
  component "Bot AI (Server Controlled)" as B
}

C1 --> S : PUSH moves
C2 --> S : PUSH moves
C3 --> S : PUSH moves

S --> C1 : PUB game state
S --> C2 : PUB game state
S --> C3 : PUB game state

S --> G : apply moves & update scores
S --> B : control bots
B --> G : bot moves

note bottom of S
Server processes all moves in arrival order.
This supports sequential consistency.
end note

@enduml